// Title: Security Audit Log Cleared (1102)
// ATT&CK: T1685.005 | Tactic: DefenseImpairment | Sigma id: b6f5fdf5-bb6b-4d0e-a999-24d54d4860a3
// Data source: SecurityEvent 1102 (Windows Security Events connector)
// Severity: High
// False positives: Administrators clearing the Security log on test machines
// Suggested analytics rule: run every 15m, look back 30m, alert when results > 0.
// Entity mapping: Host = Computer, Account = SubjectUserName
// The time filter below is for ad-hoc hunting; the analytics rule's lookback applies when scheduled.
SecurityEvent
| where TimeGenerated > ago(1d)
| where EventID == 1102
| project TimeGenerated, Computer, EventID, Activity, SubjectUserName, SubjectDomainName, TargetUserName, TargetDomainName, MemberName
